    "identifier": "leaf-gale",
    "description": "<p>You perform a Spinning low kick throwing your target off balance. A target creature in range must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, they are knocked Prone and must spend an Action to stand until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>Until the end of your turn, you can target one affected creature with a Taijutsu Finisher regardless of range, once per turn, using either an Action or Bonus action, ignoring its listed casting time.</p>",
